+#        two diagonal moves with a 45-degree turn.
+#      - virtual bar cells (2,0)(2,1)(2,2) map to actual (2,2)(3,3)(4,4), i.e.
+#        a diagonal staircase obstacle.
+#    The key metric identity is exact, not approximate:
